    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nDennehy Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional and highly versatile property, comprising two interconnecting period residences, partially converted into four apartments, and occupying a prime position in the heart of the picturesque coastal village of Crosshaven.\r\nThis unique property presents a wealth of exciting possibilities for owner-occupiers, investors and developers alike. Subject to the necessary consents, it could be restored to an impressive single family residence, divided into two separate homes, or the existing conversion could be completed to provide four self-contained apartments. The property's prominent location on Crosshaven's main thoroughfare also offers excellent commercial potential. Neighbouring occupiers include a thriving licensed premises and restaurant, while Crosshaven Credit Union, a pharmacy and the local Centra supermarket are all immediately adjacent, ensuring exceptional visibility and footfall.\r\nThe property for the most part, in sound structural condition. While extensive internal refurbishment and modernisation are required, it provides an outstanding opportunity for purchasers to create a truly distinctive residential or mixed-use development in one of Cork Harbour's most sought-after coastal villages. A property of this versatility and potential is rarely offered to the market and must be viewed to be appreciated. Potentially eligible for vacant property refurbishment grant.\r\n\r\nNorth House: \r\nComprises of front door, reception hall, stairs to first floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 3 m x 4.2 m\r\nPlastered walls and ceilings. Requires further finishing. Kitchen off.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.56 m x 2.54 m \r\nPlastered walls and ceilings. Shower Room off. Door to rear yard.\r\n\r\nFirst floor landing with door to South House and door to Bedroom/Sitting Room.\r\n\r\nBedroom/Sitting Room: 4.26 m x 2.58 m\r\nOpe to Kitchen/Dining Room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 4 m x 2.52 m\r\nShower room off.\r\n\r\nSouth House:\r\nDoor from street to sitting room.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 4.18 m x 3.56 m\r\nOpe to Kitchen/Dining Room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 5 m x 3.8 m\r\nDoor to rear yard. W.C. Ope to separate room.\r\n\r\nRoom: 3.7 m x 3.53 m\r\n\r\nFirst floor landing with sitting room off.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 4.3 m x 3.75 m\r\nOpen fireplace. Ope to kitchen/dining room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 3.66 m x 2 m\r\nDoor to bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom: 2.51 m x 3.7 m\r\nDoor to back bedroom.\r\n\r\nBack Bedroom: 3 m x 3.73 m\r\nShower room off.\r\n\r\nRear Yard: 5.8 m x 5.5 m\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nMains water, mains electricity (property has four ESB meters installed)"
      },
